# Broodrage Mycoid ({3}{B}, 4/3): "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn, create a 1/1 black Fungus creature token with 'This token can't block.'" (CR 603.4, 700.11, 111.1).
# Turn 1 Bot1 sacrifices a Black Lotus (a permanent card put into the graveyard: it descended) for {B}{B}{B}, which with Mox Jet pays for the Mycoid: one Fungus token at the end step, black 1/1 that can't block.
